        obo:IAO_0000115  "This metric checks whether the ontology metadata include detailed provenance information, namely the issued date and the publisher. Each field is checked by a separate test. The raw value of the metric is the ratio between the number of tests passed and the number of tests run by FOOPS! for this check (total_passed_tests / total_tests_run), so it ranges from 0 to 1 and higher values are better. It measures FAIR principle R1.2."@en ;
