        obo:IAO_0000115  "Degree to which the resource and its metadata are registered or indexed in a resource that can be searched, such as a catalogue, repository or search engine, so that they can be found by humans and machines. For ontologies, this includes their registration in ontology repositories and libraries such as BioPortal, OLS, the OBO Foundry, LOV or Archivo."@en ;
        obo:IAO_0000119  "GO FAIR Foundation, https://www.gofair.foundation/f4"@en , "Wilkinson, M. D. et al. (2016). The FAIR Guiding Principles for scientific data management and stewardship. Scientific Data, 3:160018. https://doi.org/10.1038/sdata.2016.18"@en ;
        dc:source        <https://doi.org/10.1038/sdata.2016.18> ;
        rdf1:acronym     "F4" .

